{"version":1,"content":"<p>今早（17日）8時許，警方接獲油塘崇信街6號一住宅單位一名34歲陳姓女子報案，指懷疑其40歲林姓丈夫於住所內，盜去其總值約45萬元財物。</p><p>警員到場經初步調查後，以「盜竊」將林拘捕，他現正被扣留調查。</p><p>案件現交由觀塘警區刑事調查隊第一隊接手跟進。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T08:39:03.144715+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T06:23:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T11:37:58.776006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:37:34.291859+00:00","content_hash":"6ee50e439d68c0939eaf9fd46d0e243708ea81968dfbbd3e7c74cf0eb64c259e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}